<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Russian premier </p>
<p>league matches played on Friday:</p>
<p> Baltika Kaliningrad*	  1  Lokomotiv Nizhny Novgorod 0 </p>
<p> Krylya Sovietov Samara**    1  Fakel Voronezh		0 </p>
<p> Kamaz Naberezhnye Chelny*** 0  Rotor Volgograd	     5 </p>
<p>Playing Saturday: </p>
<p> Zenit St Petersburg	   v  Dynamo Moscow </p>
<p> CSKA Moscow		     v  Alania Vladikavkaz</p>
<p> Chernomorets Novorossiisk   v  Zhemchuzhina Sochi</p>
<p> Spartak Moscow		  v  Shinnik Yaroslavl</p>
<p> Torpedo LM Moscow	     v  Dynamo-Gazovik Tyumen</p>
<p> Rostselmash Rostov*	   v  Lokomotiv Moscow</p>
<p>NOTE -</p>
<p>    *   in Krasnodar</p>
<p>**  in Novorossiisk</p>
<p>*** in Vladikavkaz</p>
</text>
